    12656     if valid-handle( g#fr-lib ) <> TRUE then do:       run gbl/fr-lib.p persistent no-error.       if error-status :error or valid-handle( g#fr-lib ) <> TRUE then do:         message "Error starting fr-lib.p" skip( 0 )           g#fr-lib                        skip( 0 )           g#fr-lib    :type               skip( 0 )           g#fr-lib    :file-name          skip( 0 )           error-status :get-message( 1 )  skip( 0 )           return-value                    skip( 0 )         view-as alert-box error.         stop.       end.      end.     run fr-x-rep in g#fr-lib
    12657       ( output       p-message
